  "notes": {
    "money": {
      "kind": "warn",
      "ja": "<b>正直な現状:</b> 初動2週間。<b>配信は週末に本格回復</b>し、7/24(金)・7/25(土)は1日約¥12,000（日予算の上限2倍）まで伸びた。広告アクションは累計6件（1件あたり¥6,151）。ただし「予約完了」が広告由来かは計測が始まったばかり（2026/07/24〜）。判断はもう2〜3週間データを溜めてから。",
      "en": "<b>Honest status:</b> Two weeks in. <b>Delivery recovered strongly over the weekend</b> — 7/24 (Fri) & 7/25 (Sat) each hit ~¥12,000/day (2× the daily budget cap). 6 reservation-actions so far (¥6,151 each). But whether completions came from the ad only started being measurable on 2026/07/24 — judge after 2–3 more weeks."
    },
    "sources": {
      "kind": "good",
      "ja": "<b>証明できたこと:</b> <b>広告→予約完了を1件、実データで確定</b>（Gabat Mark様・7/24・VIPテーブル。TableCheckに当社の広告タグ<code>gala_search</code>付きで記録）。¥150,000の大型予約(Tam Henry様・7/16)は<b>配信開始前の自然予約</b>＝広告成果ではない。詳細は下部「広告由来コンバージョン詳細」。",
      "en": "<b>Now proven:</b> <b>1 ad → completed reservation confirmed in real data</b> (Gabat Mark, 7/24, VIP table; stamped with our <code>gala_search</code> tag in TableCheck). The ¥150,000 booking (Tam Henry, 7/16) is <b>organic, before launch</b> — not an ad result. See \"Ad-driven conversions — full detail\" below."
    },
    "nights": {
      "kind": "",
      "ja": "<b>読み取れること:</b> 週末に配信が本格化。<b>7/24(金)¥11,990・7/25(土)¥11,996</b> の2夜で費用の約65%＝金・土が主戦場。月〜水はスケジュール通りゼロ。日予算¥6,000でも、需要の高い夜は自動で上限2倍（¥12,000）まで伸びる。",
      "en": "<b>Takeaway:</b> delivery ramped hard on weekends. <b>7/24 (Fri) ¥11,990 + 7/25 (Sat) ¥11,996</b> = ~65% of spend — Fri & Sat are the battleground. Mon–Wed zero by schedule. Even on a ¥6,000/day budget, Google spends up to 2× (¥12,000) on high-demand nights."
